  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5}+\\mathrm{i}\\left(1-\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)$\r\n$=2 \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{10} \\cos \\frac{\\pi}{10}+\\mathrm{i} 2 \\sin ^{2} \\frac{\\pi}{10}$\r\n$=2 \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{10}\\left(\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{10}+\\mathrm{i} \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{10}\\right)$\r\nFor amplitude, $\\tan \\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{10}}{\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{10}}=\\tan \\frac{\\pi}{10}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{10}$",
